  "description": "The frozen spine of the Orion family of .NET libraries: fault-safe observer invocation, OpenTelemetry naming and instrumentation conventions (ActivitySource + Meter + static tag stamping), a testable clock seam, the shared options/DI convention, and the result/error vocabulary. Depend on this from any library that wants the Orion conventions; it has no Orion dependencies of its own.",
